            "review_title": "Review at Góc Hà Nội",
            "review_text": "Annette Dupont\nHanoi, Vietnam22 contributions\n0\nThe chicken is delicious!\nMay 2023\nA Vietnamese friend took me to this restaurant. I was lost because I didn't know what to choose. Then my friend chose the dish for me. The fries are pretty ordinary, but the chicken dish is delicious! It was fried and tasted a little salty! Very delicious.\nAfter returning, I looked for the recipe, but couldn't get the same delicious taste as that day.\nThe restaurant is a bit noisy, the space is not very big. But the chicken is excellent!\nRead more\nShow original\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 11, 2023",
